      "pos_start_est": 1087
    },
    {
      "node_id": 4,
      "seq_id": 3,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ", consuming the previously generated symbols as additional input when generating the next. The Transformer follows this overall architecture using stacked self-attention and point-wise, fully connected layers for both the encoder and decoder, shown in the left and right halves of Figure",
