    },
    {
      "node_id": 5,
      "seq_id": 4,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " identical layers. Each layer has two sub-layers. The first is a multi-head self-attention mechanism, and the second is a simple, position-wise fully connected feed-forward network. We employ a residual connection ",
      "n_tokens_est": 45,
      "pos_start_est": 1171
    },
    {
